ng placed third at the last two Worlds. Russia immediately went into the lead on the first leg, followed by Belarus, Norway, and Ukraine, with Germany trailing sixth. The first five teams shot cleanly but " [:a {:href "/athletes/99552"} "Katrin Apel"] " missed four (one miss and three re-load misses) shots and skied one penalty loop for Germany. " [:a {:href "/athletes/80953"} "Uschi Disl"] " solved that problem on the second leg, with a leg that was the fastest of the event, and put Germany ahead of Bulgaria by 21.2 seconds, with Slovenia third and Russia back in seventh after " [:a {:href "/athletes/99551"} "Galina Kukleva"] " had to ski two penalty loops. But at the final exchange the order was Germany, Norway, and Russia, and that is how the medals would sort out, with Bulgaria dropping off the podium into fourth. Ukraine was not a factor, trailing back in 10th place."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Competitors"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Time"] [:th {} "Misses"] [:th {} "Extra Shots"] [:th {} "Shooting 1 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 1 Extra Shots"] [:th {} "Shooting 1"] [:th {} "Shooting 2 Misses"] [:th {} "Shooting 2 Extra Shots"] [:th {} "Shooting 2"] [:th {} "Exchange"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Germany"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "1-27:55.0"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "7"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} "– (–)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "Lead-Off"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/99552"} "Katrin Apel"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "22:15.6"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "3"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "0"] [:td {} "6:37.7 (2)"] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "3"] [:td {} "14:56.1 (12)"] [:td {